/T (Conclusion)
/E (Conclusion)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
245 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (One of the most revealing outcomes of our analysis is the disjunction between legal and discursive change. The Codice Rosso aimed at tackling gender-based violence with maximum priority, but this has not been )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [14 15]
>>
endobj
246 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (mirrored by radical transformation in how femicide is represented through media framing. If law and language are both sites of cultural meaning-making, their misalignment signals the limits of institutional change when symbolic discourse does not evolve in tandem. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
