322 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Both reviewers requested more context about our dataset and media sources. Due to word count and copyright considerations, we now refer readers directly to the original FMNews dataset paper, where article selection and cleaning procedures are fully documented. We also clarified that while the dataset includes outlets with differing political orientations, this variable was not disaggregated in our analysis, as our aim was to trace general discursive patterns. We do, however, suggest this as an avenue for future research.)
/Pg 16 0 R
>>
endobj
